3269   0E39             ;*****************************************************************************
3270   0E39             ;* Player bullet vs FLYING alien (out of formation) collision.
3271   0E39             ;* Entry (from L0E10): BC -> player-bullet structure (state at +0),
3272   0E39             ;*                     bullet X at +2, bullet Y at +3.
3273   0E39             ;* Builds the bullet's target box, then scans all 16 alien slots ($4B70).
3274   0E39             ;*****************************************************************************
3275   0E39             L0E39:
3276   0E39 03                                 INC     BC                  
3277   0E3A 03                                 INC     BC                  
