3373   0EA3 00                                 NOP                         
3374   0EA4             ;*****************************************************************************
3375   0EA4             ;* Kill with the bonus values.
3376   0EA4             ;* `L0EA4` is the common "enemy destroyed" routine:
3377   0EA4             ;* It clears the bullet's and alien's active bits, finds a free bonus explosion animation slot (`$4378`/`$4370`),
3378   0EA4             ;* and uses `D` as the animation index and `E` as the score value.
3379   0EA4             ;* (Compare the sibling entry `L0EA0: LD DE,$0C02` used for in formation kills — same mechanism, different score/anim.)
3380   0EA4             ;*****************************************************************************
3381   0EA4             L0EA4:
