3496   0F38                                    .ORG $0F38
3497   0F38             ;*****************************************************************************
3498   0F38             ;* Find the specific colliding alien (small box). HL -> alien screen X (+2).
3499   0F38             ;* B/C = ship X bounds. Alien Y must be in the bottom band ($D2,$E7).
3500   0F38             ;*****************************************************************************
3501   0F38             L0F38:
