3521   0F56             ;*****************************************************************************
3522   0F56             ;* 'Alien with player' collision check.
3523   0F56             ;* All parts of the player ship object are checked for a collision with aliens.
3524   0F56             ;*****************************************************************************
3525   0F56             L0F56:
3526   0F56 C5                                 PUSH    BC                  ;
3527   0F57 D5                                 PUSH    DE                  ;
