3854   1420             ; Alien tile-strip catalog table:
3855   1420             ; A packed list of shape strips.
3856   1420             ; Raw foreground character codes that make up each alien (and related) shape.
3857   1420             ; It is not indexed by shape number directly — drawing uses an LSB into page `$14`, usually produced by `T1600`.
3858   1420             ; Indexing chain:
3859   1420             ; movement opcode
3860   1420             ;    -> T16A0 (draw size + how to use X/Y + base into T1600)
3861   1420             ;        -> T1600[+subindex]  = LSB
3862   1420             ;            -> alien control state B
3863   1420             ;                -> HL = $14 | LSB
3864   1420             ;                    -> T1420 tile bytes drawn to screen
3865   1420             ; Duplicates track the 4-phase X/Y fine-scroll index — two phases,
3866   1420             ; same picture -> same tile pair stored (or same pointer repeated) twice.
