4468   17E0                                    .ORG $17E0
4469   17E0             ;*****************************************************************************
4470   17E0             ;* CoinChecking:
4471   17E0             ;* Converts raw `CoinCount` (`$438F`) into playable credits, applying the coinage DIP on `DSW0`.
4472   17E0             ;* Behaviour
4473   17E0             ;* | `DSW0` bit4 | Pricing            | Return value in A        |
4474   17E0             ;* |-------------|--------------------|--------------------------|
4475   17E0             ;* | **0**       | 1 coin = 1 credit  | `CoinCount`              |
4476   17E0             ;* | **1**       | 2 coins = 1 credit | `(CoinCount >> 1) & $0F` |
4477   17E0             ;* `LD A,(CoinCount)` does not touch flags, so `RET Z` still tests the `AND $10`
4478   17E0             ;* result: early exit skips the divide-by-2 when 1-coin mode is selected.
4479   17E0             ;* Callers
4480   17E0             ;* 1. Attract main loop (`$0039`) — after `AND A`, non-zero credits -> `PromptForStartGame`, else splash/demo.
4481   17E0             ;* 2. `PromptForStartGame` (`$0295`) — `CP $02`: if credits ≥ 2, also print “1 OR 2 PLAYERS”.
4482   17E0             ;* Both callers re-test **A** (`AND A` / `CP $02`); they do not rely on Z from the early `RET Z`.
4483   17E0             ;* Pairing with `DecrementCoins`
4484   17E0             ;* `$02D8`–`$02E2` uses the same DIP bit: if bit4 is set, the coin cost is doubled (1P costs 2 coins, 2P costs 4).
4485   17E0             ;* That matches `CoinChecking` reporting `CoinCount / 2` as credits.
4486   17E0             ;* In short: `$17E0` is “how many games can we start right now?”,
4487   17E0             ;* not a coin-slot reader — slot counting is in `WaitVBlankCoin`.
4488   17E0             ;*****************************************************************************
4489   17E0             CoinChecking:
4490   17E0 3A 00 78                           LD      A,(DSW0)            ; 78xx DSW0
4491   17E3 E6 10                              AND     $10                 ; 0001_0000 Coinage
4492   17E5 3A 8F 43                           LD      A,(CoinCount)       ; flags unchanged
4493   17E8 C8                                 RET     Z                   ; if bit4 clear -> return CoinCount as-is
4494   17E9 0F                                 RRCA                        ; CoinCount / 2
4495   17EA E6 0F                              AND     $0F                 ; 0000_1111
4496   17EC C9                                 RET                         ; 
