4977   2070             ;*****************************************************************************
4978   2070             ;* `L2070`/`L2085` compute the entry offset from the ship position and current phase,
4979   2070             ;* so as `CounterA5` counts down the "lit" cells sweep through the field.
4980   2070             ;* The ship visibly bursts into scattering particles that then thin out and vanish.
4981   2070             ;*****************************************************************************
4982   2070             L2070:
4983   2070 7B                                 LD      A,E                 
