7158   3264             ;*****************************************************************************
7159   3264             ;* Sub-task 0: rotate the 'start value list' pointer $4356 (0-15). If a
7160   3264             ;* pattern is fully prepared (state >= 5), reset to state 0 and write the
7161   3264             ;* chosen closed-loop pattern pointer into the movement slots ($4B50) of the
7162   3264             ;* matching aliens - launching the actual swoop.
7163   3264             ;*****************************************************************************
