8437   3980             ;*****************************************************************************
8438   3980             ;* Player shield vs. bird collision sweep:
8439   3980             ;* Active while the formation is in a vertical band.
8440   3980             ;* Borrows the player-bullet vars to probe a column above the ship,
8441   3980             ;* destroying birds the shield touches, then ticks the shield timer.
8442   3980             ;*****************************************************************************
8443   3980             L3980:
8444   3980 3A D2 4B                           LD      A,(M4BD2)           ; 
