9012   3E80             ; Bird-wave launch/spawn configuration table:
9013   3E80             ; It's read by `L3560`, the routine that sets up a new diving bird group.
9014   3E80             ; Byte 0:   -> $436E Bird count / formation-size for this dive (values `4`–`8`).
9015   3E80             ;           It's later used as a target/limit when the bird objects are populated and stepped.
9016   3E80             ; Byte 1:   (+ random, grid aligned) -> $436D Horizontal start position of the bird group.
9017   3E80             ;           (base values `$10`–`$60`). As each bird in the group is launched, the code reads $436D,
9018   3E80             ;           uses it as the X position, and advances it by 8 for the next bird.
